Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:40:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/26] Mac: texture replacement hook + button glyphs for the
 connected pad

- nv2a_metal: nv2a_tex_replace_hook (full FNV-64 of the guest bytes, decoded
  pixels in, k-times-larger BGRA8 out; nv2a_tex_replace_gen re-asks)
- apple_textures.m: providers, NFSU2_TEX_DUMP=<dir> PNG dump of new textures
- apple_prompts.m: PlayStation pad -> cross/circle/square/triangle, L2/R2;
  other pads -> LT/RT; drawn with CoreGraphics at 4x in the original's ring
  and colour; follows pad hot-plug (NFSU2_PROMPTS=auto|ps|xbox|0)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
